


SET description, "mu+ 120GeV run, trigger from MiB (plastic) + UniNa Plastic, PWO 665nm, angle 120deg. CH1: 3010 - CAEN amp 28; CH2 6050 - CAEN amp 18; CH3 LYSO; CH4 MCP; CH5 Plastic 1x1x1; CH6 Trigger"
